e task. No inventory item is required.</p><p class=\"small muted\">Completing this task does not complete a maintenance order, renew a certificate, verify stock or authorise equipment use.</p></section></section><section class=\"gt-detail-panel\" id=\"gt-panel-manage\" data-gt-panel=\"manage\" aria-labelledby=\"gt-tab-manage\"><section class=\"card gt-management\"><h2>Assignment &amp; status controls</h2><p>These actions change the assignment, not the recorded outcome of the work. Postpone / resume retains saved results. Cancel / reopen requires fresh current findings and checklist results while retaining history.</p><div class=\"gt-management-groups\"><section><h3>People and schedule</h3><div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"gt-reassign\" class=\"btn secondary\">Reassign / due date</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"gt-postpone\" class=\"btn secondary\">Postpone this task</button></div></section><section class=\"gt-lifecycle\"><h3>Task lifecycle</h3><p class=\"small\">Cancelling a task is a recorded decision. It does not close this page or sign you out.</p><div class=\"actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"gt-cancel\" class=\"btn secondary\">Cancel task</button></div></section></div><p class=\"small muted\">Scheduling retains saved-version checks. Changes to people, reduced priority and lifecycle actions need their applicable explanation. An optional postponement review date does not automatically resume the work.</p></section></section><p class=\"small muted gt-boundary\">Completing this task does not complete a maintenance order, renew a certificate, verify stock or authorise equipment use. Task notes are not maintenance readings or approvals. Source attachments remain in their original workspace.</p></section>",
